coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder organizations edit [flags]

  Edit an organization.

OPTIONS:
      --default-org-member-roles string-array
          Roles granted to every member of the organization. Accepts a
          comma-separated list and may be repeated. Pass an empty value
          (--default-org-member-roles="") to grant no roles.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
